  "document": {
    "abstract": "This specification defines a set of System for Cross-domain Identity Management (SCIM) Security Events using the Security Event Token (SET) specification (RFC 8417) to enable the asynchronous exchange of messages between SCIM service providers and receivers. This specification updates RFC 7643 by defining additional attributes for the \"urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:core:2.0:ServiceProviderConfig\" schema, and it updates RFC 7644 with an optional new asynchronous SCIM request capability.",
